before = "The Makefile only parsed deploy-contracts.sh; repair_467_test.go pinned and parsed the scripts, repair_m1319_test.go pinned them, and tests/deployment_profile.py invoked only deploy-contracts.sh check-profile. The remaining external matches are negative assertions in tools/bringup/repair_m796_test.go and tools/qualification/audit_repairs/test_repair_22_33_1320.py."
after = "Only repair_m1319_test.go and those two external refusal/absence tests match. No executable script, recipe or workflow invokes a removed file."

